icon.svg is the Fudan University emblem from Wikimedia Commons
(https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fudan_University_Logo.svg).
Original by Fudan University; vector by Prcmise. The file is in the public
domain there, but the emblem is a trademark of Fudan University. It is used
only to identify this plugin, which connects to the university's own
services; it does not imply endorsement. Its single CSS class was inlined as
a fill attribute so that SVG renderers without CSS draw it.

The UIS second-factor protocol is documented by Fudan_iCourse_Subscriber
(https://github.com/LeafCreeper/Fudan_iCourse_Subscriber/pull/55).
The Go implementation uses RFC 6238 and the Coursive provider protocol.
